{'symbol': 'QCOM', 'date': '2022-09-22 17:00:00', 'title': "QUALCOMM'S AUTOMOTIVE DESIGN-WIN PIPELINE EXPANDS TO $30 BILLION", 'text': "– GREATER THAN 2X INCREASE IN PIPELINE SINCE NOVEMBER 2021 \xa0– – SNAPDRAGON DIGITAL CHASSIS ENABLES THE CAR OF THE FUTURE –\xa0 NEW YORK , SEPT. 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- QUALCOMM INCORPORATED (NASDAQ: QCOM) ANNOUNCED AT ITS INAUGURAL AUTOMOTIVE INVESTOR DAY THAT THE COMPANY'S AUTOMOTIVE DESIGN-WIN PIPELINE HAS GROWN TO $30 BILLION 1, DRIVEN BY INCREASED ADOPTION OF ITS SNAPDRAGON® DIGITAL CHASSIS™ SOLUTIONS ACROSS THE AUTO INDUSTRY."}